.TH "ROARK\-CONNECTIONS\-AGENT\-LIST" "1" "" "roark-connections-agent-list" "Roark Analytics API Manual"
.SH "NAME"
roark\-connections\-agent\-list \- List agent connections
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B roark connections agent list
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
The project's connections to the platforms its agents run on (Retell, Vapi, LiveKit, Pipecat and others), each with its settings and latest sync. Credentials are never returned.
.SH "API"
GET /v1/connections/agent
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-provider\fR \fI<value>\fR
The platform the agents run on. LIVEKIT is LiveKit Cloud; LIVEKIT_SELF_HOSTED is the LiveKit Agents SDK reporting through the Roark plugin. PIPECAT_CLOUD_INTEGRATION and PIPECAT_SELF_HOSTED_INTEGRATION are Pipecat Cloud and a self\-hosted Pipecat bot. `GET /v1/connections/agent/providers` describes what each one needs. One of: RETELL, VAPI, ELEVEN_LABS, BLAND, LEAPING, LIVEKIT, LIVEKIT_SELF_HOSTED, PIPECAT_CLOUD_INTEGRATION, PIPECAT_SELF_HOSTED_INTEGRATION, KORE, GOOGLE_CES. Optional.
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-data\fR \fI<json>\fR
Request body as JSON, or @file to read one (@\- for stdin).
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-input\fR
Never prompt; fail instead.
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fI<url>\fR
API base URL.
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<token>\fR
Bearer token. Prefer ROARK_API_BEARER_TOKEN or the stored credential.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<ms>\fR
Request timeout in milliseconds.
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-retries\fR \fI<count>\fR
Retries for retryable failures.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<format>\fR
Output format: auto, json, jsonl, plain.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Shorthand for \-\-format json.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colour.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-essential output.
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-project\-base\-url\fR
Send the stored credential to a base URL set by a project .roark.json. Refused by default.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
